// DEPRECATED — do not edit this file.
//
// The canonical Firestore rules live at /firestore.rules (repo root),
// which is what firebase.json points to and what `firebase deploy
// --only firestore:rules` actually pushes.
//
// This file used to be a QPapers-only sketch that pre-dated the merge
// into the root ruleset (2026-05-28). It is kept as a stub so any
// stale links to `firebase/firestore.rules` resolve, but the content
// has been consolidated upstream.
//
// To change Firestore rules, edit /firestore.rules at the repo root
// and run:
//   firebase deploy --only firestore:rules
